{"ts": 1791255352.982122, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I found the Friday build requirements: you need to define your environment (state, observations, actions, dynamics) and report pass^k on at least 3 seeds. The key eval idea is:\n- pass@k = at least one of k runs succeeds\n- pass^k = all k runs succeed\nFor the build, they want reliability, so use pass^k.\n\nFor the writeup, include a short eval section with:\n1) what success means,\n2) how many seeds you ran (at least 3),\n3) the pass^k result,\n4) one sentence comparing pass@k vs pass^k.\n\nIf you want, reply with your environment description and I\u2019ll help you tighten it up.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=0 messages 4m", "t": 4, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27998147170370613, "pomdp": 0.3847194656129005, "pass_k": 0.27998147170370613}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8630104796182297, "motivation": 0.8330753570864192, "reliance": 0.3048197132422881, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
